<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cudgen RZ half yr net profit down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cudgen RZ half yr net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  8.35 vs  7.08</p>
<p>    Net profit			  1.45 vs  1.63</p>
<p>    Sales				30.47 vs 35.32</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Cudgen RZ is 76.7 percent owned by RGC Ltd following a takeover in 1996. Cudgen owns 50.14 percent of Consolidated Rutile Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
